                My first guru was the National Award-winning makeup artist
                Shri Pattanam Rasheed Sir, who gave me the foundation of
                professional makeup. Since then, I have continued to learn
                through national and international training, growing as a
                makeup artist and educator.
              </p>

              <p
                class="sec-text mb-20 pe-xl-4 wow fadeInUp"
                data-wow-delay=".7s"
